## Why This Is Asked

Tests real-time multi-tenant deployment, latency budgets, privacy guarantees, and drift monitoring in production-like settings.

## Key Concepts

- Real-time multi-tenant inference
- Early-exit and mixed-precision optimization
- DP/FL privacy guarantees and secure aggregation
- Drift detection and rollout strategy

## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudo-inference skeleton for two-tower model
function twoTowerInfer(input, tenantId, model) {
  // shared backbone
  const shared = model.backbone.extract(input.features)
  // tenant-specific embedding
  const emb = model.tenantEmbeddings[tenantId](input.userId)
  // combine and head with early exit
  const fused = concatenate(shared, emb)
  return model.heads[0](fused) // early exit path
}
```

